check 1
# Fara (178) heals: life set low by poke, then the interaction (npc.md s8 services).
name a2-npc-fara-heal
save ScnAm2 --class ama --expansion --gold 10000 --act 1 --quests acts=1
seed 1234
ticks 50
seconds 600
channels state packets
at 4 poke goto unit 1:178
at 8 poke stat @player 6 0 5120
at 14 send InteractWithEntity type=1 id=@1:178
at 16 send InitEntityChat id=@1:178
at 20 send TerminateEntityChat id=@1:178
